Subject: [PATCH 01/10] Add Emperor Bulblax (KingChappy) sampled actor with
 #227 policy mirror (#289)

13-state FSM (buried HideWait start, Appear shake-off, tongue Attack with
9-slot mouth and BOMB_Wait bomb ingestion, Flick trample, WarCry astonish
with the two-Emperor cross contract, bomb Damage/stun, damage tiers, big
f_03/force-big variant) behind a strict P2_KING_ACTOR_1 config. Actor-local
receivers only; ordinary P1 actors and P2_QUEEN_ACTOR_1 untouched.
